# Phase identity: PyRITE crystal catalog entry [4h_sic].
# Bundled full-basis P1 CIF used by the declarative material catalog.
# Catalog provenance and assumptions: ambient hexagonal 4H-SiC.
# The basal slab normal is c, so the pinned (0004) reciprocal vector is parallel to it.
# Limiting checks: V=(sqrt(3)/2)a^2c, 4Si+4C, and finite (0004) coupling.
# Validation: 4h-sic-0004-structure
